## Description

In the Mistral Large 4 SM107 (VR200) TP4/TP8 decode target, each MoE layer's main stream ran five steps in series, while the shared expert ran beside it on a side stream (#22253):
1. the router GEMM;
2. `renorm_moe_routing_op`;
3. `fp4_quantize`;
4. the pre-routed routed-expert runner;
5. a `torch.add` of the routed and shared partials, ahead of the closing all-reduce.

This PR removes three of those small kernels from the main stream by folding them into the kernels around them.

